WEBVTT

00:03.571 --> 00:05.801
I understand how hard it must be.

00:07.708 --> 00:10.768
However, you cannot
waste your mother's will.

00:11.846 --> 00:14.838
That is hidden within your name.

00:16.317 --> 00:17.909
Kamui.

00:18.018 --> 00:20.384
The one who carries out
the majesty of God.

00:20.488 --> 00:22.820
It means you will carry out...

00:22.923 --> 00:25.858
...the power and will of God
and save this world.

00:25.960 --> 00:27.689
And,

00:27.795 --> 00:30.559
"the one who hunts
the majesty of God."

00:30.664 --> 00:34.156
Don't you go off on your own like that,
my sister Hinoto.

00:34.268 --> 00:36.702
And it's awfully unfair
not telling him crucial facts.

00:36.804 --> 00:38.431
Who are you?

00:39.840 --> 00:41.774
Nice to meet you, Kamui.

00:41.876 --> 00:43.844
I am Kanoe.

00:43.944 --> 00:45.707
Younger sister to Hinoto.

00:47.181 --> 00:51.117
I'm not a dreamseer, but I can enter
other people's dreams.

00:52.319 --> 00:55.482
I watch the dreams
that my sister sees.

00:55.589 --> 00:57.147
Stop it, Kanoe!

00:57.258 --> 00:58.919
Get out of my dream!

00:59.026 --> 01:00.493
Tell me.

01:00.594 --> 01:04.052
There are two meanings
for the name "Kamui."

01:04.165 --> 01:06.258
"The one who hunts
the majesty of God."

01:06.367 --> 01:09.928
In other words, the one who hunts
those given God's power,

01:10.037 --> 01:11.766
and destroys the world.

01:12.873 --> 01:16.775
So you do have the potential
to be a Dragon of Heaven,

01:16.877 --> 01:19.243
but you also could
be a Dragon of Earth.

01:19.346 --> 01:21.211
What do you mean by that?

01:21.315 --> 01:23.306
You have two futures.

01:25.085 --> 01:28.111
One as a Dragon of Heaven,
the other as a Dragon of Earth.

01:28.222 --> 01:32.659
Even Hinoto, who has not once
predicted the future incorrectly...

01:32.760 --> 01:34.887
...could not
determine your future.

01:35.963 --> 01:38.761
That dream was one
that works better for her.

01:38.866 --> 01:40.629
Don't you want to see
the other future?

01:40.734 --> 01:42.031
Kanoe!

01:42.136 --> 01:43.296
The other future?

01:44.371 --> 01:45.269
Yes...

01:48.576 --> 01:49.474
Wait!

01:50.346 --> 01:55.111
Episode 8
Gemini

02:40.794 --> 02:42.386
Don't worry.

02:42.496 --> 02:44.396
Leave the rest to me and run.

02:52.539 --> 02:53.699
Good evening.

02:53.807 --> 02:54.705
Done with prayers?

03:05.919 --> 03:06.943
Forgive me, O Lord...

03:30.177 --> 03:32.737
A Dragon of
Heaven's Barrier Field.

03:35.449 --> 03:37.713
The Diet meeting is at 3:00.

03:37.818 --> 03:41.549
4:30, endorsement for a House
candidate at Shinjuku Station.

03:41.655 --> 03:44.453
6:00, dinner with
the former governor in Akasaka.

03:44.558 --> 03:47.391
- At 8:00...
- Oh, all right, all right.

03:47.494 --> 03:49.121
That's enough.

03:49.229 --> 03:51.493
You look rather tired.

03:51.598 --> 03:53.998
Well, I can't really
say that I am.

03:54.101 --> 03:57.093
The speech and the visit
to the U.S. Military base...

03:57.204 --> 04:01.607
...has been postponed to next week
so that you can rest well.

04:01.708 --> 04:03.972
Ah, you really notice things.

04:04.077 --> 04:05.339
It helps me out.

04:05.445 --> 04:06.571
You're welcome.

04:10.050 --> 04:11.517
Well, excuse me.

04:11.618 --> 04:12.516
Sure.

04:16.023 --> 04:18.583
Oh, I'm sorry
to bother you at work.

04:18.692 --> 04:20.023
What's wrong?

04:20.127 --> 04:23.790
There was something I wanted
to let you know immediately.

04:23.897 --> 04:27.025
You know when I met
the interesting Osaka boy...

04:27.134 --> 04:30.831
...I also saw someone able to walk
into the Barrier Field, right?

04:30.938 --> 04:33.338
Yes, I remember that.

04:33.440 --> 04:35.499
I found out who he was.

04:35.609 --> 04:38.874
It turns out he is a student
in Kamui's high school.

04:40.180 --> 04:41.772
Fuma Monou.

04:41.882 --> 04:43.247
The family records say...

04:43.350 --> 04:46.342
...he's the first son
of the Togakushi shrinekeeper.

04:46.453 --> 04:47.511
Togakushi?

04:47.621 --> 04:51.557
Yes, the shrine where
that Divine Sword was kept.

04:51.658 --> 04:52.955
Excuse me...

04:53.060 --> 04:54.687
All right.

04:54.795 --> 04:57.855
I wrote the details in an e-mail,
so please read it.

04:57.965 --> 04:58.863
Later.

04:59.933 --> 05:01.560
Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:01.668 --> 05:02.566
Um, I want this.

05:02.636 --> 05:04.399
Marriage Certificate

05:05.939 --> 05:07.804
Turning in
your marriage certificate?

05:07.908 --> 05:09.808
Um, yes.

05:09.910 --> 05:11.901
Congratulations.

05:12.012 --> 05:14.640
You fit very well.
I wish you happiness.

05:14.748 --> 05:17.012
I have sent you
a photo of Fuma Monou.

05:23.890 --> 05:24.879
That can't be.

05:26.360 --> 05:27.327
Nice shot!

05:31.331 --> 05:33.424
Amazing. Nothing less.

05:33.533 --> 05:36.696
The national championship's
no dream if Monou's around.

05:39.506 --> 05:40.404
All right!

05:40.540 --> 05:42.007
Monou!

05:42.109 --> 05:44.077
Your sister called!

05:44.177 --> 05:46.372
Go to the hospital immediately!

06:04.498 --> 06:05.556
Big Brother!

06:06.667 --> 06:08.066
Father!

06:08.168 --> 06:11.194
He's been calling your name
all this time.

06:11.304 --> 06:12.669
Father, it's me!

06:12.773 --> 06:14.001
I'm right here.

06:15.142 --> 06:16.541
Fuma.

06:16.643 --> 06:18.406
Yeah, it's me.

06:18.512 --> 06:20.605
I'm right here next to you.

06:20.714 --> 06:21.976
There is...

06:23.817 --> 06:25.444
...something important...

06:26.553 --> 06:30.011
...that I have to talk...
to you about.

06:30.123 --> 06:31.021
Father!

06:37.431 --> 06:39.831
Y-You are...

06:39.933 --> 06:42.493
You are... Kamui's...

06:44.638 --> 06:45.662
Kamui's...

06:53.914 --> 06:54.812
Father?

06:57.250 --> 06:58.182
Father!

06:58.285 --> 06:59.149
Father!

06:59.252 --> 07:00.310
Father!

07:13.066 --> 07:15.364
Tomb of the Monou family

07:34.287 --> 07:35.185
It's tough...

07:36.423 --> 07:39.324
You say farewell
to your parents someday,

07:39.426 --> 07:41.291
but this is too soon.

07:41.394 --> 07:43.692
I was like that, too.

07:43.797 --> 07:46.561
I'm sure that it was
the same for you all.

07:50.237 --> 07:51.932
Who are you?

07:52.038 --> 07:53.767
Sorry for surprising you.

07:53.874 --> 07:55.341
I'll introduce myself.

07:55.442 --> 07:56.636
Karen Kasumi...

07:56.743 --> 07:58.540
...one of the Seven Seals.

07:58.645 --> 07:59.907
One of the Seals?

08:00.013 --> 08:00.945
Right.

08:01.047 --> 08:02.412
A firemaster.

08:02.516 --> 08:03.414
Yes.

08:03.517 --> 08:05.883
You've heard about me
from Miss Hinoto, right?

08:05.986 --> 08:07.283
But in any case,

08:07.387 --> 08:09.480
that's a marvelous
outfit you got.

08:09.589 --> 08:11.955
It doesn't suit a funeral, though.

08:12.058 --> 08:13.355
I'm sorry.

08:13.460 --> 08:16.020
I snuck out of work
to come here.

08:16.129 --> 08:17.027
Work?

08:19.833 --> 08:21.562
I was asked to hand this to you.

08:21.668 --> 08:25.297
It's from Tokiko Magami,
your aunt.

08:25.405 --> 08:27.464
Tokiko Magami.

08:27.574 --> 08:29.474
That's Kamui's
mother's younger sister.

08:30.577 --> 08:33.444
Well, I did hand it to you.

08:33.547 --> 08:35.708
I have to go back to work.

08:35.816 --> 08:37.215
Hey, lady!

08:37.317 --> 08:41.583
Lady, since you claimed yourself
to be one of the Seven Seals,

08:41.688 --> 08:44.714
you know that this world
is in danger, right?

08:44.825 --> 08:47.555
Yes, and I also
know about Kamui.

08:47.661 --> 08:52.655
But I didn't think he'd be such a cute,
little high school student.

08:52.766 --> 08:56.429
So are you affiliated
with some religious group, too?

08:56.536 --> 08:58.026
I'm with Flower.

08:58.138 --> 08:59.332
Flower?

08:59.439 --> 09:02.169
- W-Was there such a group?
- I don't know.

09:03.577 --> 09:05.067
It's my workplace's name.

09:05.178 --> 09:06.702
W-What kind of workplace?

09:06.813 --> 09:09.179
I'll leave that to your imagination.

09:09.282 --> 09:10.180
Later.

09:15.922 --> 09:17.753
I smell soap.

09:18.925 --> 09:19.914
That means...

09:22.596 --> 09:24.496
When the moon is full...

09:24.598 --> 09:28.728
...I'll give you the Divine Sword
at Togakushi Shrine.

09:28.835 --> 09:29.733
Tokiko Magami.

09:31.238 --> 09:32.535
The Divine Sword...

09:34.274 --> 09:36.299
What did the letter say, Kamui?

09:36.409 --> 09:37.933
What did Miss Tokiko want?

09:38.044 --> 09:39.204
It's nothing.

09:39.312 --> 09:40.802
N-Nothing?

09:40.914 --> 09:42.472
You're too secretive, Kamui!

09:42.582 --> 09:43.913
We're buddies, right?

09:44.017 --> 09:45.712
Don't get me wrong.

09:45.819 --> 09:49.118
I never thought of
any of you as "buddies."

09:49.222 --> 09:50.519
B-But...

09:51.625 --> 09:53.320
I'll make it clear.

09:53.426 --> 09:56.827
I have no interest in
the Dragons of Heaven or Earth.

10:06.273 --> 10:08.298
Then we'll be going now.

10:08.408 --> 10:10.342
Thank you so much.

10:25.125 --> 10:26.888
Thanks for coming.

10:29.329 --> 10:30.694
Are you all right?

10:30.797 --> 10:31.855
Yeah.

10:31.965 --> 10:34.160
I was a little prepared for it.

10:34.267 --> 10:37.293
But I think Big Brother
took it harder than me.

10:37.404 --> 10:39.065
Fuma did?

10:39.172 --> 10:41.902
He must be tired
of putting up a front.

10:52.018 --> 10:54.282
Y-You are...

10:54.387 --> 10:57.720
You are... Kamui's...

10:57.824 --> 10:58.950
Kamui's...

11:00.093 --> 11:02.254
Twin star...

11:03.797 --> 11:05.458
Kamui's twin star...

11:07.367 --> 11:09.460
What does that mean, Father?

11:15.141 --> 11:16.165
Don't worry.

11:17.277 --> 11:20.371
Fuma isn't one who'd
let anything beat him.

11:21.448 --> 11:23.109
You're right.

11:23.216 --> 11:25.946
You're doing your best
by yourself, Shirou...

11:26.052 --> 11:28.577
...so we have to do our best, too.

11:28.688 --> 11:29.586
Yeah.

11:30.857 --> 11:32.722
And someday,

11:32.826 --> 11:35.886
I'm sure something
good will happen.

11:35.996 --> 11:37.463
Someday.

11:37.564 --> 11:39.691
You have a dream
for the future, right?

11:41.501 --> 11:45.403
What you said when I saw you
in the library.

11:46.973 --> 11:49.806
You remembered that, Shirou?

11:49.909 --> 11:53.276
How I wanted to be
a professional indigo dyesmith.

11:55.782 --> 11:56.942
I hope it comes true.

11:58.051 --> 11:58.949
Thank you.

12:12.599 --> 12:14.658
Kamui's still squareheaded,

12:15.769 --> 12:18.897
but he's always
honest in front of that girl.

12:19.005 --> 12:20.870
It does no good to rush things.

12:20.974 --> 12:22.373
It'll come to be someday.

12:22.475 --> 12:23.942
Shirou.

12:25.045 --> 12:27.513
What are your dreams
for the future?

12:28.882 --> 12:31.407
If you have any,
I'd like to hear them.

12:31.518 --> 12:34.214
I-I don't have anything.

12:47.734 --> 12:48.792
W-What's this?

12:54.040 --> 12:54.938
Kamui!

12:57.010 --> 12:58.477
Where are you, Kamui?

12:59.579 --> 13:01.479
W-What's going on?

13:09.656 --> 13:11.146
W-What is this?

13:17.864 --> 13:19.627
What's going on with me?

13:24.204 --> 13:25.102
Kotori!

13:27.640 --> 13:29.130
Big Brother.

13:38.051 --> 13:39.109
Stop it!

13:40.186 --> 13:41.676
Kamui!

13:50.363 --> 13:51.887
I finally found him.

13:55.001 --> 13:56.025
Kamui!

14:09.616 --> 14:10.878
Kamui.

14:10.984 --> 14:12.884
I am your...

14:24.297 --> 14:26.026
What is all this?

14:26.132 --> 14:27.599
Don't leave my side.

14:34.307 --> 14:39.540
It appears I've invited
an unexpected lady here, as well.

14:40.613 --> 14:41.875
Damn you.

14:41.981 --> 14:45.007
You're the one that poked me
in the Diet Building!

14:45.118 --> 14:47.279
Are you one of the Seven Angels?

14:47.387 --> 14:48.877
Yes.

14:48.988 --> 14:51.980
You chased me away
that one time, though.

14:53.092 --> 14:55.287
Demon summon, Shukuyindo.

15:03.102 --> 15:05.434
Rin. Byou. Tou. Sha.

15:06.506 --> 15:08.838
To get Kotori
involved in this now...

15:12.745 --> 15:14.007
I can't forgive you!

15:25.892 --> 15:28.122
Shiki Shukudosho!

15:28.228 --> 15:29.126
Flight!

15:47.347 --> 15:48.336
Kotori!

15:56.022 --> 15:56.989
Kotori...

15:57.090 --> 15:59.354
You're so kind.

15:59.459 --> 16:02.019
If you're occupied
with the young lady,

16:02.128 --> 16:03.993
you can't dodge
the next attack.

16:28.421 --> 16:29.649
F-Fuma.

16:36.095 --> 16:36.993
Why...

16:38.131 --> 16:42.761
Not only did he enter my illusion,
but he countered my spell.

16:43.870 --> 16:46.361
I have another thing
to look forward to.

17:02.422 --> 17:03.252
Fuma...

17:04.957 --> 17:05.855
Kamui...

17:07.293 --> 17:08.954
I am your...

17:10.063 --> 17:11.087
...twin star.

17:28.348 --> 17:29.713
Kamui?

17:29.816 --> 17:31.613
Hey, how did you get hurt?

17:35.421 --> 17:36.319
Kamui!

17:39.258 --> 17:40.657
Kamui, are you all right?

17:44.697 --> 17:46.221
Take care of Kotori.

17:51.104 --> 17:52.731
What happened, Kamui?

17:56.376 --> 17:58.241
You don't remember anything?

17:59.812 --> 18:01.507
Hurry, take Kotori.

18:02.582 --> 18:03.879
Kamui...

18:03.983 --> 18:07.749
Is this why you kept Kotori
and me at a distance?

18:25.104 --> 18:26.628
Tend to the wounds.

18:28.040 --> 18:31.100
Was it the guy who attacked
us under the Diet Building?

18:32.512 --> 18:33.376
Yeah.

18:34.480 --> 18:38.712
So one of the Seven Angels
is indeed Sakurazukamori.

18:38.818 --> 18:41.810
We really have to do
something about this.

18:47.393 --> 18:48.360
Kamui.

18:49.695 --> 18:51.162
I am your...

18:52.532 --> 18:53.726
...twin star.

19:37.143 --> 19:38.474
How are you doing?

19:40.513 --> 19:42.777
You're like always, Big Sister.

19:42.882 --> 19:45.009
I'm your only blood relative, too.

19:46.085 --> 19:48.519
I have wonderful news today.

19:48.621 --> 19:51.852
Something very special
to tell you, Big Sister.

19:51.958 --> 19:56.019
Though I can't see the future
in dreams like you,

19:56.128 --> 20:00.121
I can eavesdrop over your dreams
as you cross them.

20:04.904 --> 20:08.670
I saw the dream about
two Divine Swords and two Kamuis.

20:10.776 --> 20:14.234
I finally realized what
that dream meant.

20:14.347 --> 20:17.544
That there is more
than one Kamui.

20:17.650 --> 20:19.242
The other Kamui...

20:19.352 --> 20:21.650
Yes, Kamui has a twin star.

20:22.755 --> 20:25.246
It looks like I've found him.

20:25.358 --> 20:26.256
Kanoe!

20:27.827 --> 20:30.887
Two Kamuis
and their two futures.

20:30.997 --> 20:34.023
The other Kamui
will awaken very soon.
